1
00:00:05,144 --> 00:00:08,064
(Sheldon(off):)I'm going to need a larger shirt.

2
00:00:11,692 --> 00:00:13,732
(Sheldon(off):)This one's a little tight under the arms.

3
00:00:13,945 --> 00:00:15,275
(Howard(Picks up receiver):)Okay.

4
00:00:15,488 --> 00:00:18,118
(Leonard:)Maybe it's tight because
you're wearing long underwear?

5
00:00:18,324 --> 00:00:20,154
(Sheldon:)Yes, of course that's why it's tight.

6
00:00:22,370 --> 00:00:23,750
(Leonard:)Let me rephrase the question.

7
00:00:23,955 --> 00:00:26,455
(Leonard:)- Why are you wearing long underwear?
- You're kidding.

8
00:00:26,666 --> 00:00:29,756
(Sheldon:)Shouldn't the question be,
why aren't you?

9
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:33,340
No, it should be, why are you?

10
00:00:33,673 --> 00:00:35,803
(Sheldon:)Leonard, these rental tuxedos...

11
00:00:36,008 --> 00:00:39,048
(Sheldon:)...have been worn by hundreds
of sweaty strangers.

12
00:00:39,262 --> 00:00:41,262
l don't like my own sweat
touching my skin.

13
00:00:41,472 --> 00:00:43,642
(Sheldon:)How do you think I feel about theirs?

14
00:00:44,225 --> 00:00:47,475
- Why don't you slip this on?
- Said the hangman offering a noose.

15
00:00:49,105 --> 00:00:52,275
Heh, well, that wasn't as entertaining
as when he rents bowling shoes...

16
00:00:52,483 --> 00:00:54,113
(Raj:)...but it was right up there.

17
00:00:54,944 --> 00:00:57,984
(Howard:)Well, that's it.
My orders have been rescinded.

18
00:00:58,197 --> 00:01:00,537
l am officially "no go" to space.

19
00:01:00,741 --> 00:01:04,701
I'm sorry, Howard, but I gotta tell you,
I'm a little relieved you're not going.

